# D3-FE-001: Sugar conversion can occur without gas production
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
add v1 water 50mL @ 30C
add v1 sucrose 1g
add v1 dry_yeast 0.5g
add v2 water 50mL @ 30C
add v2 sucrose 1g
add v2 yoghurt_culture 0.5g
add v3 water 50mL @ 30C
add v3 sucrose 1g
seal v1 500mL
seal v2 500mL
seal v3 500mL
wait 8h
measure v1 pressure
measure v2 pressure
measure v3 pressure
measure v1 ph
measure v2 ph
inspect
